class:: Gate
summary:: Gate or hold.
related:: Classes/Latch
categories::  UGens>Triggers


Description::

Allows input signal value to pass when gate is positive, otherwise holds last value.


classmethods::

method::ar, kr

argument::in
The input signal.

argument::trig

Any signal to act as the gate trigger.

When code::trig <= 0.f:: the last input value is held. Otherwise, the input passes through.

code::
(
{
	var trig = LFPulse.ar(30, iphase: 0.25);
	[
		trig,
		Gate.ar(SinOsc.ar, trig)
	]
}.plot(0.1)
)
::

Examples::

code::

s.boot;
// Control rate so as not to whack your speakers with DC
{ Gate.kr(WhiteNoise.kr(1, 0), LFPulse.kr(1.333, 0.5)) }.scope(zoom: 20);

::
